<p>We denote the first pointer as leader and the pointer that follows it as=
 trailer. When the leader pointer reaches the last node of the linked list,=
 we want the trailer pointer to end up at node 4 (the node right before the=
 kth last node) to prepare for deletion. In other words, the leader should =
be k nodes in front of the trailer when the leader reaches the last node.</=
p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
